  "releaseNotes": "0.8.0\n- Harden native FastText bindings with explicit input lengths and argument validation\n- Improve native error reporting for invalid handles, model buffers, and prediction arguments\n- Return empty prediction lists for non-positive prediction counts\n- Remove forced native CPU flags for broader runtime compatibility\n- Add NuGet package icon and expanded package tags",
